    8.1.0
    flags लाई from ENT_COMPAT बाट ENT_QUOTES | ENT_SUBSTITUTE | ENT_HTML401 मा परिवर्तन गरियो।

  &reftitle.examples;



    एउटा htmlspecialchars_decode उदाहरण


<?php
$str = "<p>this -&gt; &quot;</p>\n";

echo htmlspecialchars_decode($str);

// note that here the quotes aren't converted
echo htmlspecialchars_decode($str, ENT_NOQUOTES);
?>


    &example.outputs;


<p>this -> "</p>
<p>this -> &quot;</p>
